  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Justice Assistance Network Review</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To conduct an independent review of the UK Government&#x2019;s Justice Assistance Network to assess whether it remains fit for purpose in enabling effective coordination of the UK Government&#x2019;s approaches to justice assistance interventions overseas.  This will contribute to the UK&#x2019;s efforts to ensure that its support is strategic and effective in its provision of improved security and justice for poor people in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
